    <data key="d0">The New York Times Multi-Account Architecture with Control Tower and EKS</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jBffL9zUCSE</data>
    <data key="d2">Centralized runtime EKS cluster communicates via Transit Gateway to vended developer accounts managed by Control Tower.</data>
    <data key="d3">Multi-Account / Governance</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
